<title>USA: CBOE to list options on AMRESCO Sept 17.</title>
<headline>CBOE to list options on AMRESCO Sept 17.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Board Options Exchange said Friday it will begin trading options on AMRESCO Inc on September 17.</p>
<p>The options will trade on the March expiration cycle, with introductory expirations in October, November, December and March. Initial strike prices are set at 20, 22-1/2 and 25.</p>
<p>Chicago Derivatives Desk (312)408-8750</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
